.page pushd 1 keep a stack of directories
.alias popd dirs

# SYNOPSIS
*pushd* _DIRECTORY_
*popd*
*dirs*

# DESCRIPTION
These gapsh builtins keep a stack of directories (up to 32). `pushd` remembers the current directory and changes to _DIRECTORY_. `popd` goes back to the directory most recently pushed and forgets it. `dirs` prints the current directory followed by the stack, most recent first.

# EXIT STATUS
1 if `pushd` has no argument or cannot change directory, and if `popd` finds the stack empty.

# EXAMPLES
    pushd /Hakurei/etc
    dirs
    popd

# SEE ALSO
cd(1), gapsh-builtins(7)
